{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Pre-sweep against origin/main d74d53a5ffd before spending a gate slot. Three defects fixed in the description; none would have been caught by re-measuring line numbers alone.\n\n1. THE docs/README.md DELETION SET WAS INVERTED. The plan deleted 136 and 138 and kept 137 and 139. Measured, 136 is bash-migration.md and 138 is release-notes.md -- two LIVE docs this story does not delete -- while 137 is dco-rollout-evidence.md and 139 is serena-symbol-reference-coaching-sample.md, two of the five files it DOES delete. It also omitted 126 (oss-comparison-and-remediation) and 135 (88ab-feature-branch-evidence) entirely. Following the old list would have dangled four links to deleted files and unlinked two maintained docs, failing check_docs_index.py in both directions. Corrected set: 58, 74, 126, 127, 135, 137, 139; keep 67, 136, 138. The error is a clean off-by-one through the Historical-evidence block, consistent with the eval-harness story shifting those lines after this plan was written.\n\n2. scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py HOLDS NO PHANTOM CITATION. git grep sync-hardening -- scripts is empty. Its :85-90 is the _TEACHING string and is unrelated to this work. The file is removed from the edit list and from file_impact.\n\n3. THE RECONCILER TEST PATH DOES NOT EXIST AS CITED. The plan named tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_field_contract.py:88; there is no tests/unit/rebar_reconciler directory. The live hit is tests/unit/reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_field_contract.py:46.\n\nConfirmed unchanged: all five evidence files and both stubs are present with the cited line counts (775, 232, 225, 115, 83, 13, 13); docs/README.md:58, :67 and :74 resolve exactly as cited; check_docs_index.py --check passes rc=0 on the clean tree, so the gate is a real oracle for AC2. AC3's three phantom hits are the only ones in scripts, tests, docs or src, so the AC can reach empty.\n\nAC5 line numbers corrected 130/142 -> 129/141."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793473929643262001,"uuid":"1382fe0f-fb6c-4569-8ffb-720e75fd319a"}